{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_01",
      "hash": "6aead4e0ca20f79e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～！要不要用\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的小拉達來交換……\\r\\n我的小拉達呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_02",
      "hash": "6aead3e0ca20f5eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～真是遺憾！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_03",
      "hash": "6aead2e0ca20f438",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_04",
      "hash": "6aead9e0ca21001d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊～！好開心！\\n那我們開始交換吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_05",
      "hash": "6aead8e0ca20fe6a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嚇了一跳吧？我的小拉達\\n來自阿羅拉地區喔！\\c\\n就算是同一種寶可夢，\\n依照出生地的不同，\\c\\n有可能會擁有\\n不同的形態或屬性喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_06",
      "hash": "6aead7e0ca20fcb7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嗨～！還想再用\\n關都的小拉達來交換\\r\\n阿羅拉的小拉達嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub062_miniskirt_07",
      "hash": "6aead6e0ca20fb04",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_01",
      "hash": "e79f3df307b71a1f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我專程從阿羅拉來到這裡，\\n就是為了大量收集關都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]。\\c\\n如果[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有[VAR POKNAME(0004)]的話，\\n就來和我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]交換吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_02",
      "hash": "e79f3ef307b71bd2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……這樣啊。\\n要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳改變主意了，記得來找我啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_03",
      "hash": "e79f3ff307b71d85",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_04",
      "hash": "e79f38f307b711a0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳願意把牠換給我嗎？\\n很好！交換成立！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_05",
      "hash": "e79f39f307b71353",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "感謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳促成這次美好的交換！\\n阿羅拉的樣子的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\c\\n和關都的不同，\\n擁有冰屬性哦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_06",
      "hash": "e79f3af307b71506",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳還願意拿關都的\\n[VAR POKNAME(0004)]和我的\\r\\n[VAR POKNAME(0004)]交換嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub063_boyscout_07",
      "hash": "e79f3bf307b716b9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝了！哎呀～關都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n真是讓人愛不釋手啊～\\c\\n當然阿羅拉的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n也很可愛呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_01",
      "hash": "6dda7e9a6151ef78",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "關都的地鼠\\n頭頂都是這麼滑不溜丟的嗎？\\c\\n想不想用牠來交換\\n我這頭頂刺刺的地鼠呢？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_02",
      "hash": "6dda819a6151f491",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……別這樣吊人胃口嘛。"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_03",
      "hash": "6dda809a6151f2de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 16]"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_04",
      "hash": "6dda839a6151f7f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呵呵！我興奮得心跳加速呢。\\n那麼，要交換了喔……"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_05",
      "hash": "6dda829a6151f644",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呀啊！真的呢～！\\n好滑不溜丟的感覺～！\\c\\n能遇見[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳真是太好了！\\n以後要再來跟我交換喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_06",
      "hash": "6dda859a6151fb5d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我又想用刺刺的地鼠\\n來交換[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳那\\r\\n滑不溜丟的地鼠了呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub064_woman_07",
      "hash": "6dda849a6151f9aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "滑不溜丟的地鼠\\n不管看幾隻都是這麼可愛呢！\\r\\n下次再來和我交換吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_01",
      "hash": "0edd0ba62ac6c684",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳對惡屬性有興趣嗎？\\n要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有[VAR POKNAME(0004)]的話，\\c\\n我倒是可以用惡屬性的\\n[VAR POKNAME(0004)]跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳交換……"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_02",
      "hash": "0edd0ea62ac6cb9d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呵，那就算了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_03",
      "hash": "0edd0da62ac6c9ea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 23]"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_04",
      "hash": "0edd08a62ac6c16b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呵，決定了嗎？\\n那就開始交換吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_05",
      "hash": "0edd07a62ac6bfb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "惡屬性的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n也是挺可愛的對吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_06",
      "hash": "0edd0aa62ac6c4d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "又想要惡屬性的寶可夢了嗎？\\n要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有關都的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]的話，\\c\\n我是可以用我的[VAR POKNAME(0004)]\\n跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳交換……"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "msg_sub065_gang_07",
      "hash": "0edd09a62ac6c31e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳還真喜歡惡屬性啊。\\n要是想再沾染一點邪惡氣息的話，\\r\\n再來找我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_01",
      "hash": "169a75a819e149d9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是來自阿羅拉的\\n雷丘愛好者！\\c\\n拿[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的關都雷丘\\n來和我的雷丘交換吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_02",
      "hash": "169a72a819e144c0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真的很可愛喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_03",
      "hash": "169a73a819e14673",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 30]"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_04",
      "hash": "169a78a819e14ef2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "決定好要換哪一隻了嗎？\\n那我們就來交換吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_05",
      "hash": "169a79a819e150a5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿羅拉的雷丘擁有\\n電和超能力這兩種屬性。\\c\\n牠可是能透過招式學習器學會\\n「精神強念」的超棒寶可夢喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_06",
      "hash": "169a76a819e14b8c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我是來自阿羅拉的\\n雷丘愛好者！\\c\\n再拿[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的關都雷丘\\n來和我交換\\r\\n阿羅拉的雷丘吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "msg_sub066_elitef_07",
      "hash": "169a77a819e14d3f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要讓更多人知道\\n阿羅拉雷丘的可愛之處喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_01",
      "hash": "7877d33166b0ec78",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳好！不知道[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有沒有\\n地面屬性的嘎啦嘎啦？\\c\\n如果可以的話，\\n我想用我的嘎啦嘎啦跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳交換……"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_02",
      "hash": "7877d63166b0f191",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那就不勉強[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "msg_sub064_gentle_03",
      "hash": "a5de094ea254826f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 37]"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_04",
      "hash": "7877d83166b0f4f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "做好心理準備了？\\n那麼……"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_05",
      "hash": "7877d73166b0f344",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔哦！我最喜歡\\n地面屬性的嘎啦嘎啦了！\\c\\n要是將來還有機會，\\n再拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳跟我交換了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_06",
      "hash": "7877da3166b0f85d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我想拿我的阿羅拉嘎啦嘎啦\\n和[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的地面屬性嘎啦嘎啦交換，\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳覺得如何？"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "msg_sub067_gentle_07",
      "hash": "7877d93166b0f6aa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "果然關都的嘎啦嘎啦\\n就得是地面屬性啊……！\\c\\n要是將來還有機會，\\n再拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳跟我交換了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_01",
      "hash": "8e4f1b712d924db0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳……如果有椰蛋樹的話，\\n我可以把我引以為傲的\\r\\n椰蛋樹交換給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳。要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_02",
      "hash": "8e4f1e712d9252c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那可是我引以為傲的椰蛋樹啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_03",
      "hash": "8e4f1d712d925116",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 44]"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_04",
      "hash": "8e4f20712d92562f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "請收下我\\n引以為傲的椰蛋樹……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_05",
      "hash": "8e4f1f712d92547c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這隻椰蛋樹很厲害吧～！\\n在遙遠的阿羅拉地區，\\c\\n椰蛋樹們可以自由自在地成長，\\n所以才長得這麼高大！"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_06",
      "hash": "8e4f22712d925995",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "又想來交換\\n我引以為傲的椰蛋樹了嗎？\\c\\n如果[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳有短脖子的椰蛋樹，\\n我可以和[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳交換喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "msg_sub068_pokemaniac_07",
      "hash": "8e4f21712d9257e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "只是因為生長的環境不同，\\n就能產生如此大的變化。\\c\\n生命真是妙不可言啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_01",
      "hash": "608d3c6d3ab94808",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "要用[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的小拳石\\n來換我的小拳石嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_02",
      "hash": "608d3f6d3ab94d21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔……遺憾啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_04",
      "hash": "608d416d3ab95087",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔哈哈！太好了！\\n那我們就來交換吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_05",
      "hash": "608d406d3ab94ed4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哇哈哈！嚇了一跳吧！？\\n我的小拳石可是\\r\\n阿羅拉的樣子！\\c\\n如果[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳還有關都的小拳石，\\n我可以再跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳交換喔。"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_06",
      "hash": "608d436d3ab953ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳又想來和我\\n交換小拳石嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "msg_sub069_mountain_07",
      "hash": "608d426d3ab9523a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳我透過交換小拳石\\n所萌生的友誼……\\c\\n真是太動人啦！\\n哇哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_01",
      "hash": "4f8eb624ac6a712d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小迷你"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_02",
      "hash": "4f8eb324ac6a6c14",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "露冰冰"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_03",
      "hash": "4f8eb424ac6a6dc7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "蒂淑"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_04",
      "hash": "4f8eb124ac6a68ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "達懷丹"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_05",
      "hash": "4f8eb224ac6a6a61",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "晶瑩丘"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_06",
      "hash": "4f8eaf24ac6a6548",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "紳士嘎啦"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_07",
      "hash": "4f8eb024ac6a66fb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "椰蛋迷"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "msg_trade_trainer_name_08",
      "hash": "4f8ead24ac6a61e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小拳男"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_field_trade_max",
      "hash": "8c9e2badd8100921"
    }
  ]
}
